  "prompt": "For each landing page, count the engaged sessions that started from 1 to 14 December 2025, by event_date. The landing page is the page_location parameter of the session's session_start event, as text, and a session is engaged when its session_engaged parameter is '1', as text. A session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id, counted from its session_start event; leave out session_start events whose user_pseudo_id or ga_session_id is missing. Return page_location and engaged_sessions. Return one row for each landing page with at least one engaged session. Any row order is fine.",
